		(descr "Waveshare ESP32-S3-Matrix (25.00 x 25.00 mm, R1.0, 8x8 RGB LED). Top view = LED face, USB-C at top (-Y). Origin = board centre. 2x10 pins at 2.54 mm, columns 22.86 mm apart. Pads 1-10 = left column top-to-bottom (5V, GND, 3V3, IO7, IO6, IO5, IO4, IO3, IO2, IO1); pads 11-20 = right column top-to-bottom (IO33-IO40, TX, RX). Source: waveshare.com/wiki/ESP32-S3-Matrix (Dim drawing, ESP32-S3-Matrix-Sch.pdf).")
